---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="Septic System Design & Permits Arizona | Diaz Environmental LLC"
  description="ADEQ-approved septic system design and permits in Arizona. Fast 3-5 business day turnaround. Serving Maricopa, Pinal & surrounding counties. Call (602) 812-8609."
  canonical="https://diazenviroaz.com/septic-system-design-arizona"
>
  <main class="service-page">
    <section class="service-hero">
      <h1>Septic System Design & Permits in Arizona</h1>
      <p>ADEQ-approved septic system design with the fastest turnaround in Maricopa County — 3 to 5 business days from soil testing to permit submission.</p>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn">Get a Free Quote</a>
    </section>

    <section class="service-body">
      <h2>What's Included in Our Septic Design Service</h2>
      <p>At Diaz Environmental LLC, we handle every step of the septic design process in-house. Because we own our own excavator and drilling equipment, we can move faster and at lower cost than competitors who subcontract this work.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Site and soil evaluation</li>
        <li>Percolation testing</li>
        <li>ADEQ-compliant system design</li>
        <li>Permit submission to the county</li>
        <li>Coordination with your contractor or installer</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Why Choose Diaz Environmental for Your Septic Design</h2>
      <p>We average 3–5 business days from soil testing to permit submission — one of the fastest turnarounds in Arizona. We are fully certified by ADEQ and have extensive experience with Maricopa County, Pinal County, and surrounding jurisdictions.</p>
      <p>We also offer consultations in Spanish — <strong>¡Hablamos español!</strong> — making us the preferred choice for Arizona's Spanish-speaking community.</p>

      <h2>Areas We Serve</h2>
      <p>We provide septic system design services throughout Phoenix, Scottsdale, Mesa, Chandler, Gilbert, Queen Creek, San Tan Valley, Maricopa, Cave Creek, Anthem, New River, Wickenburg, Buckeye, Goodyear, Fountain Hills, Rio Verde and all of Maricopa, Pinal, Pima, Yavapai and Coconino Counties.</p>

      <h2>Diseño de Sistemas Sépticos en Arizona</h2>
      <p>Diaz Environmental LLC ofrece diseño completo de sistemas sépticos aprobados por ADEQ en todo Arizona. Contamos con nuestro propio equipo de excavación y perforación, lo que nos permite ofrecer los tiempos de respuesta más rápidos del condado. ¡Llámanos hoy!</p>
    </section>

    <section class="service-cta">
      <h2>Ready to Start Your Septic Design?</h2>
      <p>Call <a href="tel:6028128609">(602) 812-8609</a> or fill out our contact form for a free consultation.</p>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn">Contact Us Today</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .service-page { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 4rem 2rem; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; }
  .service-hero { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 4rem; }
  .service-hero h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 800; color: #154a2a; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .service-hero p { font-size: 1.1rem; color: #555; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .service-body h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #154a2a; margin: 2rem 0 1rem; }
  .service-body p { color: #444; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .service-body ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .service-body ul li { padding: 0.4rem 0 0.4rem 1.5rem; position: relative; color: #444; }
  .service-body ul li::before { content: "✓"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: #154a2a; font-weight: 700; }
  .service-cta { text-align: center; background: #f0f7f2; border-radius: 12px; padding: 3rem 2rem; margin-top: 4rem; }
  .service-cta h2 { font-size: 1.7rem; color: #154a2a; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .service-cta p { color: #555; margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .service-cta a[href^="tel"] { color: #154a2a; font-weight: 700; }
  .btn { display: inline-block; background: #154a2a; color: white; padding: 13px 30px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; transition: background 0.3s; }
  .btn:hover { background: #0d3019; }
</style>